<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 1.4 trln yen in three-month T-bills.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 1.4 trln yen in three-month T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday it was offering 1.4 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be July 22 and the maturity date will be October 20, 1997.</p>
